description: "Two exhibits against probabilistic conditional logic at maximum entropy (Kern-Isberner and colleagues), one declared group each, whole-block copies of the toy battery with suffixed ids: the penguin example written six ways, and the independence half of syntax splitting. Each head states the question and the measured answer under the shipped solve."
